#  bit 10 BC4      off
#  bit 11 BC4s     off
#  bit 12 BC5      off
#  bit 13 BC5s     off
#  bit 14 BC6Hu    off
#  bit 15 BC6Hs    off
#  bit 16 BC7      off
#  bit 22 ASTC-LDR on

